    faqs: [['What is the average website development cost in India?', 'There is no useful single average because a small business website, corporate website, e-commerce store, and custom web application have different scope and risk. A reliable estimate needs requirements, content, integrations, design expectations, testing, and support to be defined.'], ['What makes a business website more expensive?', 'Multiple audiences, custom functionality, integrations, content migration, complex design systems, e-commerce, bookings, accounts, accessibility, SEO migration, and ongoing support can all increase the work involved.'], ['Should I choose a cheap website package?', 'Compare outcomes, ownership, quality, accessibility, performance, security, content control, support, and what is excluded. A low initial quote can become expensive if essential work is missing or the website is difficult to maintain.']],
